<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Subscription Suspended - Blue Sky Outsourcing</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; }
        .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #757f9a 0%, #d7dde8 100%); padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; color: #333333; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 18px; color: #333333; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .message { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .suspended-box { background-color: #fff3cd; border-left: 4px solid #ff9800; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
        .suspended-box h3 { margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #f57c00; font-size: 18px; }
        .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; }
        .info-label { font-weight: 600; color: #333333; }
        .info-value { color: #555555; }
        .cta-button { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9800 0%, #f57c00 100%); color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin: 10px 5px; }
        .reassurance-box { background-color: #e3f2fd; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 4px solid #2196f3; }
        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #777777; }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { .content { padding: 30px 20px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">🔒</div>
            <h1>Subscription Suspended</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Hi <%= name %>,</div>
            
            <div class="message">
                Your subscription has been temporarily suspended due to payment failure after multiple retry attempts.
            </div>
            
            <div class="suspended-box">
                <h3>Account Status</h3>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Plan:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= planName %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Amount Due:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= currency %> <%= amount %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Suspended On:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= suspensionDate %></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="reassurance-box">
                <strong>🛡️ Your Data is Safe!</strong>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #555555;">
                    We'll keep your account data for 30 days. You can reactivate your subscription anytime during this period.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                <strong>To reactivate your subscription:</strong>
                <ol style="color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li>Click the button below to update your payment method</li>
                    <li>Pay the outstanding amount</li>
                    <li>Your subscription will be reactivated immediately</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= reactivateLink %>" class="cta-button">Reactivate Subscription</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message" style="font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-top: 20px;">
                Need a different plan or have questions? Contact us at 
                <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #ff9800;"><%= supportEmail %></a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>Blue Sky Outsourcing</strong></p>
            <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Blue Sky Outsourcing. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

